WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.378
Learn to round (off, up, down) whole numbers up to 10000 to the nearest, thousands,

00:00:05.378 --> 00:00:10.902
hundreds and tens and skip count forwards and backwards in 50s and 100s up to and

00:00:10.902 --> 00:00:11.592
from 10000

00:00:12.450 --> 00:00:19.896
Round 3,116 up to the next multiple of 10. The answer is 3,120. Use groups of 10 and

00:00:19.896 --> 00:00:21.965
the instruction “round up to”.

00:00:22.783 --> 00:00:29.165
A market records about 8,695 visitors. Estimate to the nearest 100. Pause and solve

00:00:29.165 --> 00:00:31.445
it in your exercise book.

00:00:32.283 --> 00:00:38.107
The answer is 8,700. Round 8,695 to the nearest 100.
